WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.003 --> 00:00:02.603
Add a book you already published

2
00:00:03.112 --> 00:00:09.333
Already published a book elsewhere? You can still list it on your website.

3
00:00:09.336 --> 00:00:22.722
Type its ISBN and press Look up. The title, author, description and cover are filled in for you.

4
00:00:22.725 --> 00:00:29.758
Check the details, then choose Add to my website. Nothing to retype.
